      "created": 1792747975498,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "My Laptop\n\n\nNIC Cards - 1 for wifi, 1 for Ethernet, maybe any other as well\n\nEach NIC card gets a MAC address\n\nEach NIC card also gets an IP address in local network (e.g - 192.168.1.5\nmaybe my wifi nic local IP)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "pS13p44bG5XMbtcXc59sg",
      "originalText": "My Laptop\n\n\nNIC Cards - 1 for wifi, 1 for Ethernet, maybe any other as well\n\nEach NIC card gets a MAC address\n\nEach NIC card also gets an IP address in local network (e.g - 192.168.1.5 maybe my wifi nic local IP)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
