      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "My router\n\nIt has internal NIC (for wifi / LAN) and external NIC for internet\n\nConsequently it also get internal and external IPs\n\n192.168.1.1 maybe (and usually is) router's internal IP.\n\nMy router also has a public IP given by the ISP, which is the IP services over\nthe internet see",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "a9EAApTUMYq8rf5E5EDDR",
      "originalText": "My router\n\nIt has internal NIC (for wifi / LAN) and external NIC for internet\n\nConsequently it also get internal and external IPs\n\n192.168.1.1 maybe (and usually is) router's internal IP.\n\nMy router also has a public IP given by the ISP, which is the IP services over the internet see",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
